Comment: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:30.25,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,JP-定位點 name
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:36.72,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}看吧 這一切都如初
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:44.18,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}一如平常 你的描摹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:48.10,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}玻璃般的線條略過
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:53.78,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}看吧 這些恢復如初
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:59.86,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}細碎但總能有一日
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:07.96,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}我也不明 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:15.55,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}魔法現在 藏哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.55,0:21:23.68,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}捉迷藏 繼續看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:30.69,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,0)}祈願 留到明天吧
Comment: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,CN,,0,0,0,,OP前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,CN,Teacher,0,0,0,,下一題 久世
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.35,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,啊 好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.95,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,答案是六點六噼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:15.28,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,答案是 六點六
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:16.58,CN,Teacher,0,0,0,,正確
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:22.91,CN,Girl N,0,0,0,,聲音好小 根本聽不見說的什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:30.02,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻里奈什麼都沒有做呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.59,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:36.06,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,也許 這說不定是和好的第一步噼
Comment: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:52.58,CN - down,,0,0,0,,正文
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:56.99,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}感覺 我好久沒有和別人一起散步了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:58.47,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,是嗎噼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.12,0:02:06.05,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,以前 我還經常和父親一起出來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:07.52,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,原來你有爸爸啊噼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:12.43,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,有的 不過他在我小時候就出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:15.23,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,原來也有這種情況啊 人類
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:23.73,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,那天父親離開的夜晚 也像現在一樣星星滿天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:28.27,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,我拚命地向星星大人祈願
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:34.12,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,「希望爸爸媽媽不要離婚」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.93,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,但 根本沒有實現
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:47.37,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,那時候我就想 魔法並沒有 神明也不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:54.22,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,聽到靜香說這些話 我還是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.23,0:02:59.19,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,總感覺我們的關係變得更好了 好開心噼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:04.33,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,「上次」像這樣抬頭仰望繁星之時 要更加
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:07.08,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:12.47,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,那個時候記得是和靜香相遇的第六天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:14.43,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,正好就是今天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:18.32,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,然後 靜香自殺的日子 就是那一天之後
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:19.88,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,也就是 明天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:24.50,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香拿著恰噼的項圈來到公園裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:27.99,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:32.15,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,為什麼那個時候 恰噼它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.20,0:03:36.08,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不在呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:41.77,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,在這個時間出來 真夠下賤的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:45.28,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,果然 賣屁股也是會遺傳的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:47.16,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,麻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.42,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.99,0:03:52.53,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,啊 是汙穢的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:54.70,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:55.14,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,之前我就在想了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:59.84,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,寄生蟲和淫婦還有資格養狗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:01.54,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}恰噼快回來 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:04.18,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,我再問你話 快回答我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:07.27,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,一個人無法生活的寄生蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:10.15,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,連狗屎都沒資格購買的賤貨 我在問你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:11.19,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}麻 麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:13.53,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}她不是變得溫柔了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.13,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我好害怕動不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.03,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.14,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:33.09,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,好痛 有誰能救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.95,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,狗 恐怖的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.95,0:04:36.33,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,襲擊了我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:37.58,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,快報警還有聯繫醫院
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:39.34,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,快點把它給抓起來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.32,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這是發生了什麼噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:46.43,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:50.89,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,等會 恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.28,0:04:54.63,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,哭了 靜香她竟然哭了噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:57.91,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這樣子絕對不行的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:04:59.32,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我會
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:04.05,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我會想辦法解決噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:09.72,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章魚噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:12.70,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,改變一下散步的路線吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:14.18,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,你在說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:17.69,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,這條路上 有什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:18.94,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:19.84,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,今天 只要不經過公園
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.06,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不碰見麻里奈的話就沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:24.55,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,啊 在這在這
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:24.14,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:28.27,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這個趨勢不對勁噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:30.72,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,換成早上散步怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:35.15,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,散步明天再去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:40.44,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊嘞 好奇怪噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:44.23,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不管在哪裡 無論多少次恰噼它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:48.54,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,好 進展順利 沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:51.50,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,不枉我好找了一番啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:53.12,CN,Teacher B,0,0,0,,小姑娘 你沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:53.87,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:57.06,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,原來是麻里奈主動找的她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:56.43,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}我什麼都沒做它就突然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:58.12,CN,Teacher B,0,0,0,,已經可以放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:06:01.38,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,欸 但是這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:04.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,想要避開她就會變得很困難啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:08.95,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,而且麻里奈為什麼要來故意被狗咬呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:12.15,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,明明很痛的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:18.19,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,對啦 去問問同樣是人類的靜香吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:21.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,說不定就能知道麻里奈的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.73,0:06:24.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:26.90,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,有個問題想要問問你噼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:28.33,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:33.59,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,等我 別丟下我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:39.45,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:43.97,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這樣子的話 靜香她會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.49,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:54.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.89,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我絕對會 幫助你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:04.23,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,為了讓你一直 能和恰噼歡聲笑語每一日
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.30,0:07:07.24,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,就算這次不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:11.12,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,只要能無數次重來 肯定能找到解決的辦法噼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:15.91,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,為了讓你 不再做悲傷的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:20.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,所以請你 相信我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.93,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章魚噼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:28.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這次的我一定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:36.65,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,會讓你 綻放最美好的微笑噼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:45.03,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,所以 靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:49.29,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,恰噼的話 就送去你爸那了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:53.64,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,咬了人的狗不能在這鎮上住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:57.18,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,所以總有一天你能去找它的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:07.03,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:14.69,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,歸根結底 明明是那傢伙擅自留下來的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:16.69,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,啊 還有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:21.63,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,麻里奈是吧 她的傷也不算太嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:24.70,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,但她母親雲母坂女士好像挺生氣的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:27.33,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,真的 麻煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:31.44,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,礙於那個人的面子 我還得去道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:36.45,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,真的 你別再給我惹麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:41.54,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,那就這 我先去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:45.63,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,晚餐你隨便吃點吧 早上我就會回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:48.88,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,說起來 靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:52.58,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,你頭上帶著折耳根花做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:56.89,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,那之後我無論嘗試多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:09:01.26,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,無論如何恰噼都會被帶走噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.26,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,但是 我絕對不會放棄噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:10.38,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,畢竟 靜香現在還好好地活著
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:13.12,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,所以我會努力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:16.48,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,把恰噼從她爸爸那邊給帶回來的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:19.68,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香 沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.96,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我一定會把恰噼給帶回來的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:25.84,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,所以 我希望你能打起精神噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:31.24,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,「爸爸的那邊」是在哪裡呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:34.56,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我現在就去看看噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:40.36,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香 你肚子餓不餓噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:44.67,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,來吧 這是午餐的麵包 來吃吧噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:55.68,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,要怎麼樣做 你才能綻放笑容呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:00.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,對啦噼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:03.07,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,去學校和大家見面的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:07.08,CN,Boy I,0,0,0,,哇 果然她真的來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.02,CN,Marina's friend A,0,0,0,,聽說了嗎 麻里奈她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:11.39,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,聽說了 聽說了 受了好嚴重的傷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:12.04,CN,Marina's friend C,0,0,0,,{\an8}肯定是這個人叫狗咬她的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:13.08,CN,Boy I,0,0,0,,{\an8}居然還 有臉回學校
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:28.24,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,啊哈 這不是那個管理不好臭狗的害人女嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:29.90,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,早安呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.80,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你還真敢來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:35.24,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,噼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:38.55,CN,Teacher,0,0,0,,那麼 到此為止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:41.39,CN,Teacher,0,0,0,,下節課要走班 不要遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:45.39,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,麻里奈我啊 手可是血流成河啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:46.71,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,好過分
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:47.95,CN,Marina's friend C,0,0,0,,要賠償醫藥費呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:51.92,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,說不定還會得狂犬病呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.89,0:10:53.81,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,噼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:56.17,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,道歉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:58.76,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,吶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:00.74,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,雲 雲母坂同學
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:05.57,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,下節課要去音樂室 趕緊過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:09.44,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,啊 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:11.79,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,音樂課要帶什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:13.37,CN,Marina's friend C,0,0,0,,豎笛和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:16.42,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,久 久世同學 你還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:19.44,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,身體不舒服的話可以去醫務室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:23.29,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,如果有我能幫上忙的 儘管
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.35,0:11:34.81,CN,Marina's friend C,0,0,0,,吶 那傢伙不管什麼都沒反應真的太噁心了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:36.83,CN,Marina's friend A,0,0,0,,好無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:38.48,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,明天 怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.19,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:46.11,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,大家抱歉 今天各位先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:47.86,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,欸 是有什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:51.01,CN,Marina's friend A,0,0,0,,這樣啊 明天再見啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:07.22,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:19.38,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香 完全沒有精神噼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:23.26,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊 難不成
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:27.51,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,你是不是肚子餓了 午餐你都沒怎麼吃噼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:29.11,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,寄生蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.64,0:12:31.24,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻 麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:35.09,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,有事和你說 借一步說話唄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:43.45,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,別無視我 臭女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:53.24,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,來聊聊 靜香你最喜歡的「可愛恰噼」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:56.10,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.99,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香她說話了噼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:58.98,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}那麼 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:02.07,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這樣就能精神地和麻里奈溝通
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:06.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不 這不對噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:09.44,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這說不定是個好機會噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.44,0:13:12.69,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這次兩人說不定會和好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:16.60,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,既然如此 我也不能再逃避了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:19.49,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,雖然恐懼 但也要勇敢面對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:24.93,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我要幫助兩人和好如初噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.27,0:13:27.79,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,等等我噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:33.80,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:42.15,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,你就不能回來早一點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:43.90,CN,Marina's dad,0,0,0,,又是這句話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:46.32,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,麻里她也是很寂寞的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:46.77,CN,Marina's dad,0,0,0,,{\an8}我可是在外面辛勤工作但是你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.71,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,麻里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:54.27,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,麻里 你能明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:57.86,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,只有你永遠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:02.16,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,站在媽媽這邊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.57,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰 恰噼的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:23.79,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,那狗 早死了 怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:27.58,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,它沒有死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:28.57,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:32.55,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,沒有死的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.00,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}早死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:34.66,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,死了 死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.57,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,它去了爸爸在的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:38.54,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}早就死了 死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:41.40,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,隨時回來都可以的 看這是它的項圈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:46.49,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,咬了孩子的手 送到動物收治所
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:50.08,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,它必然會死的 白癡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:54.50,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你個雜草爸爸都沒 溫柔的媽媽也不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:58.13,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,沒有朋友 誰也不會關心你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:15:01.04,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,唯一一個和你下賤的狗也死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:05.18,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,吶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:08.21,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你也死了算
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:11.81,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,恐怖噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:13.82,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,恐恐恐恐 恐怖噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:18.21,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}活著淨是給人添麻煩的寄生蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:18.09,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,非常恐怖噼 恐怖到一步都走不動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:19.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:23.50,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你覺得你的生活費是從哪裡來的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.31,0:15:26.70,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,是從我爸爸的錢包裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:29.87,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你穿的衣服 吃的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:34.32,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,全部都是你他媽 從男人身下吸上來的錢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:34.78,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}恰 噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:38.68,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,明明是我的爸爸每天努力做事賺錢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:40.74,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:41.54,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,「要是你不在的話」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:53.80,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,爸爸就會給媽媽 買新的戒指並送給她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:16:00.62,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,不是那種素未謀面的妓女 而是更關心麻里奈的家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:07.98,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不 不不不不 不好啦噼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:11.77,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香她 肯定非常痛的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.77,0:16:13.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,要馬上去幫助她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:15.17,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,對啦噼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:18.45,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我要用快樂相機 再次重新來過
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:19.04,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:23.09,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,要是你不生在世上 媽媽她就會和以前一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.18,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:29.14,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,只要有恰噼在 我就沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:32.23,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,其它一切無所謂的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:35.18,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,就算發生什麼也都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.87,0:16:40.10,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,無論多麼痛苦 多麼難受
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:42.69,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:45.08,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這樣子的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:50.26,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,若只是旁觀 肯定會重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:52.77,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:57.80,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.61,0:17:00.75,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,把我爸爸還回來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:02.48,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,要拿出勇氣出來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.00,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:11.89,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這次的我 絕對要「拯救」你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:38.14,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:43.49,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻里奈 她一動也不動了噼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.89,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,難道是太痛了嗎噼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.34,0:17:48.67,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:50.92,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:54.83,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,感覺好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:56.95,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,雖然痛痛 不是什麼好事情噼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:00.44,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,要趕快用快樂相機重新來過 好好溝通一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.36,0:18:04.65,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊嘞噼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:13.63,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,她死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:16.06,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:20.42,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,她絕對 死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:24.80,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,死 欸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:27.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,是我的錯吧 什麼東西紅紅的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:28.59,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}麻里奈死了 快樂相機無法運作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:29.97,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,怎麼辦 故障了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:32.75,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章魚噼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:39.30,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章魚噼 你好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:41.48,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:45.39,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,好厲害好厲害好厲害 真的好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:48.92,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,我啊 雖然一直都不相信魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:51.86,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,但實際上 我一直都在想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:55.37,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,麻里奈要是不在的話就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.37,0:18:57.57,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,這樣 我就不會討厭學校了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.95,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,但是 我什麼都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:04.78,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,反正這個願望也不會被實現
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.72,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,但是 真的成真了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:10.64,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,真的實現了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.12,0:19:12.57,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:15.50,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,就像是魔法一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:19.97,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,是 是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:21.23,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:23.64,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,魔法真的存在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:26.34,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,那肯定恰噼也還活著的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:30.48,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,只要去爸爸在的地方 肯定能再見的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:36.23,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,這 真的可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:37.50,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章魚噼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:42.65,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,謝謝你 章魚噼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.73,0:19:45.43,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,謝謝你「殺了」她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:49.00,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,在你們人類的語言裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:53.59,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,剝奪他人生命被稱為「殺人」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:58.87,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,靜香她 終於對我笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.52,0:20:02.91,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,那麼 我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.24,0:20:08.61,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,太陽系第三行星地球
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:12.16,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,從快樂星球到達這裡的第七天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:22.66,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我的真正「故事」從此刻「無法重新來過 」開始
